85 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (During this quarter, we celebrated several significant milestones. Two of our graduates completed their studies at ITM College Austria, demonstrating the international opportunities that quality hospitality education can unlock. We also welcomed back the Class of 2025 to celebrate their outstanding performance in the South African Sommeliers Association \(SASA\) Introductory Sommelier Examination. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
86 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (Our students continued to benefit from meaningful industry engagement, including an inspiring session with acclaimed chefs Margot Janse and Jan Hendrik van der Westhuizen, whose experiences provided valuable insights into leadership, resilience and professional growth. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
87 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (We also expanded our impact through short learning programmes, with 18 participants successfully completing our Foundation Wine & Service course, alongside the continued delivery of our Food & Beverage Customer Service & Concierge programme, creating further opportunities for skills development within the local hospitality sector.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
