201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (We proudly celebrates the outstanding achievement of two of our graduates, Dillon Samuels and Jason Williams, who have successfully completed their two-year studies at ITM College Austria.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (Their graduation marks the culmination of two years of dedication, resilience, personal growth and hard work. Leaving home to pursue their studies abroad required courage and determination as they embraced a new country, new cultures, new challenges and invaluable learning opportunities.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (What makes this milestone particularly meaningful is that both students come from our local community. Their success demonstrates how talent, commitment and access to quality education can create opportunities on a global stage. They have not only achieved personal success but have also become inspiring role models for younger generations, their families and the wider community.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (Their journey is a powerful reminder of the transformative impact of education on individuals, families and communities. It reinforces the Academy's commitment to developing future hospitality professionals who are equipped to thrive both locally and internationally.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (We extend our heartfelt congratulations to Dillon and Jason on this remarkable accomplishment and look forward to following their continued success as they embark on the next chapter of their careers.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
