/P 72 0 R
/E (During the quarter, 18 participants successfully enrolled in and completed the Foundation Wine & Service course. Over several weeks, participants developed a solid understanding of wine theory, wine service, food and wine pairing, guest interaction and the fundamentals required for the South African Sommeliers Association \(SASA\) Foundation Certificate. The programme equips students with practical skills and confidence to deliver exceptional wine service in professional hospitality environments.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
243 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Alongside this, the Academy also offered its Food & Beverage Customer Service & Concierge course, designed to strengthen front-of-house service excellence. The programme focused on customer service, table service techniques, menu and product knowledge, effective communication and concierge skills, while also introducing participants to Franschhoek's tourism offerings.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
